{'symbol': 'IVZ', 'date': '2021-12-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'INVESCO MORTGAGE CAPITAL INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA, DEC. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INVESCO MORTGAGE CAPITAL INC. (THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IVR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.09 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON JANUARY 27, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 11, 2022, WITH AN EX-DIVIDEND DATE OF JANUARY 10, 2022.'}